WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:03.441
Willy: [i@Hee-haw! Hee-haw!@i]

2
00:00:03.442 --> 00:00:09.632
Kyle: It's okay, Willy. Banjo is just saying hi.

3
00:00:09.633 --> 00:00:18.154
Kyle: Everyone's at the pond. Come on, Banjo!

4
00:00:18.155 --> 00:00:22.095
Ben: Wow. Your dog is huge, Kyle!

5
00:00:22.096 --> 00:00:26.667
Kyle: Yep! Everyone, this is Banjo.

6
00:00:26.668 --> 00:00:30.715
Kyle: He's really friendly and likes to play.

7
00:00:30.716 --> 00:00:35.130
Riley: It's okay, Snooks.

8
00:00:35.131 --> 00:00:38.447
Snooks: [i@Ar-ooo!@i]

9
00:00:38.448 --> 00:00:44.469
Riley: Oh no. Come back, Snooks!

10
00:00:44.470 --> 00:00:50.517
Skyler: Ahh! Snooks just knocked over Chatter's cage!

11
00:00:50.518 --> 00:00:55.220
Skyler: Chatter, no! Don't fly away!

12
00:00:55.221 --> 00:01:02.168
Sarah: Ouch! Pepper scratched me—and took off!

13
00:01:02.169 --> 00:01:07.328
Ben: She just ran up that tree.

14
00:01:07.329 --> 00:01:11.911
Skyler: Chatter just flew to that tree too!

15
00:01:11.912 --> 00:01:14.860
Theo: At least Frankie is calm.

16
00:01:14.861 --> 00:01:16.971
Frankie: [i@Ribbit!@i]

17
00:01:16.972 --> 00:01:20.325
Theo: Oops. There goes Frankie!

18
00:01:20.326 --> 00:01:24.958
Theo: Help—he's really fast! And I can't catch him!

19
00:01:24.958 --> 00:01:28.786
Frankie: [i@Ribbit!@i]

20
00:01:28.787 --> 00:01:33.100
Ben: Oh no! Frankie jumped into the pond!

21
00:01:33.101 --> 00:01:36.426
Kyle: What's wrong with your pets?

22
00:01:36.427 --> 00:01:41.497
Ben: They're scared of Banjo!

23
00:01:41.498 --> 00:01:44.567
Theo: Frankie, where are you?

24
00:01:44.568 --> 00:01:49.522
Theo: This is terrible. I'll never find him.

25
00:01:49.523 --> 00:01:52.888
Riley: We'll help you look for Frankie, Theo.

26
00:01:52.889 --> 00:02:01.715
Theo: I don't see him anywhere.

27
00:02:01.716 --> 00:02:08.298
Riley: There he is—sitting on a lily pad!

28
00:02:08.299 --> 00:02:11.919
Theo: That lily pad in the middle of the pond?

29
00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:19.400
Riley: We need a long net. I'll check the barn.

30
00:02:19.401 --> 00:02:23.008
Banjo: [i@Woof! Woof!@i]

31
00:02:23.009 --> 00:02:30.894
Skyler: No, Banjo! Stop barking. You're scaring Chatter.

32
00:02:30.895 --> 00:02:33.528
Sarah: Pepper is scared too.

33
00:02:33.529 --> 00:02:38.362
Kyle: Your animals are scared of everything.

34
00:02:38.363 --> 00:02:41.814
Snooks: [i@Ar-ooo!@i]

35
00:02:41.815 --> 00:02:44.785
Riley: I found a net. Now we can—

36
00:02:44.786 --> 00:02:47.690
Mack: Campers! What's going on here?

37
00:02:47.691 --> 00:02:52.234
Riley: Oh no. We wanted to make Mack happy.

38
00:02:52.235 --> 00:02:59.759
Riley: But we made him mad—on the last day of camp!

